s and 90’s horror movies. If I look at this as a budget title then it’s hard not to be satisfied. However this doesn’t forgive the original state of this game at launch at least it can be enjoyed now at the right price.", "timestamp_created": 1729708489, "timestamp_updated": 1729708489, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 17, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.55165410041809082", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177596108", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024967919", "personaname": "Tacitus Kilgore", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024967919/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 344, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 56, "last_played": 1730435349, "avatar": "62b6da647f7d187bd0812a3ffa58db3fd928bab6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Long live Arkane Austin.", "timestamp_created": 1729704027, "timestamp_updated": 1729704027, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481297522783279419", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177595867", "author": {"steamid": "76561198232376408", "personaname": "Purplefire180", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/purplefire180/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 55, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 55, "last_played": 1729627143, "avatar": "bce10ec46b619fd7a8660cc783d36462d44aa89e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly seems like it'd be a fun game, if it played continuously without crashing for more than 10 minutes. From what i saw, the stealth was pretty janky, but the combat was generally fun. Definitely has a lot in common with Deathloop gameplay-wise.", "timestamp_created": 1729703750, "timestamp_updated": 1729703750, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516531050205230713", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177553617", "author": {"steamid": "76561198817629883", "personaname": "drakeflake", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/360873742374/", "num_games_owned": 359, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 44, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 44, "last_played": 1729636670, "avatar": "0bfd6a007df7f197f6b622848c60547bc3e611a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "i rly gave this game a fair shot after reading some of the more recent reviews. and its just not good. all the enemies dont respond when you start shooting their friends. enemies lose track of u even if ur in the same spot because they teleported around. if they fixed the AI of the enemies i could look past the other stuff. but that combined with a (from what ive seen) pretty empty world, that things in the distance look bad even though i have the graphics on max and not getting past the main menu because they put TOS behind a loading screen wich made TOS unable to be agreed on. i dont recommend this game. one thing i do wanne say is that landing headshots does feel good. even if its on basically standing still targets", "timestamp_created": 1729637267, "timestamp_updated": 1729637267, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 15, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.549257397651672363", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck